- Intended Walsh route: 222 operations

G9 and Step 4 remain blocked: every OpenRouter request returned HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded.” The reports correctly retain `all_passed: false`; no oracle failure was fabricated. Once quota is restored, rerun the three harness arms and update `G9_ORACLE_RESULTS`. The mathematical grounding was verified against the [full paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1504.01656).
