Paper grounding and Step 0.  Section 2, Definition 2.1 defines an SOS
derivation p = sum_i r_i p_i + sum_j s_j q_j + s_0, where the p_i are
equational axioms, every s_j and s_0 is a sum of squares, and the r_i are
